    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mastodon bookmarks → Wallabag\nEvery 5 minutes, new Mastodon bookmarks are saved to Wallabag.\n\n- Remembers the last bookmark ID in a **Data Table** (no duplicates, no re-processing)\n- Skips URLs that **already exist** in Wallabag\n- Saves the link card when present, otherwise the first link of the toot, otherwise the toot itself\n\n⚠️ Requires the community node **n8n-nodes-wallabag** and n8n with **Data Tables**.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "bebfc2d7-4778-4ddd-a6bc-356dbab063a8",
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. Install the community node `n8n-nodes-wallabag`\n2. Create a Mastodon access token with the `read:bookmarks` scope\n3. Add an **HTTP Bearer Auth** credential with this token → select it in *Fetch new bookmarks*\n4. Replace `YOUR_MASTODON_INSTANCE` in the *Fetch new bookmarks* URL\n5. Create a **Wallabag API** credential and select it in the 4 Wallabag nodes\n6. Create a Data Table `mastodon_sync_state` with 2 string columns: `source`, `min_id` → select it in *Get sync state* and *Save min_id*\n7. (Optional) Set `DEFAULT_MIN_ID` in *Prepare min_id* and test with *Execute workflow*, then activate",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "id": "c5c11995-d636-454f-a634-606cef893bd4",
      "name": "Setup"
    },
